{'review': '{\n  "review": "<<<ARTIFACT review_report>>>\\n{\\n  \\"overall_status\\": \\"NEEDS_FIXES\\",\\n  \\"quality_score\\": 6.5,\\n  \\"summary\\": {\\n    \\"critical\\": 0,\\n    \\"high\\": 0,\\n    \\"medium\\": 3,\\n    \\"low\\": 1,\\n    \\"passed_checks\\": [\\n      \\"JWT secret validation\\",\\n      \\"Global exception handler logs and returns generic error\\",\\n      \\"HTTPS redirection enabled\\",\\n      \\"Swagger configured for development\\",\\n      \\"Authentication and Authorization middleware added\\",\\n      \\"All endpoints protected with [Authorize]\\",\\n      \\"Async/await used correctly\\",\\n      \\"Result pattern used for service responses\\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\"findings\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\"finding_id\\": \\"F-001\\",\\n      \\"severity\\": \\"medium\\",\\n      \\"category\\": \\"quality\\",\\n      \\"title\\": \\"Missing validation for JWT Issuer and Audience configuration\\",\\n      \\"file\\": \\"src/Api/Program.cs\\",\\n      \\"line_range\\": [34, 49],\\n      \\"description\\": \\"The JWT Issuer and Audience values are retrieved from configuration without validation. If missing, they will be null, causing token validation to fail during authentication.\\",\\n      \\"impact\\": \\"Authentication will fail for all tokens if Issuer or Audience is not configured, leading to application instability.\\",\\n      \\"suggested_fix\\": \\"Add null checks for JWT Issuer and Audience similar to the secret validation, throwing descriptive exceptions if missing.\\",\\n      \\"code_before\\": \\"var jwtSecret = builder.Configuration[\\\\\\"Jwt:Key\\\\\\"] ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\\\\\\"JWT Secret Key not configured.\\\\\\");\\\\nbuilder.Services.AddAuthentication(options =>\\\\n{\\\\n    options.DefaultAuthenticateScheme = JwtBearerDefaults.AuthenticationScheme;\\\\n    options.DefaultChallengeScheme = JwtBearerDefaults.AuthenticationScheme;\\\\n})\\\\n.AddJwtBearer(options =>\\\\n{\\\\n    options.TokenValidationParameters = new TokenValidationParameters\\\\n    {\\\\n        ValidateIssuer = true,\\\\n        ValidateAudience = true,\\\\n        ValidateLifetime = true,\\\\n        ValidateIssuerSigningKey = true,\\\\n        ValidIssuer = builder.Configuration[\\\\\\"Jwt:Issuer\\\\\\"],\\\\n        ValidAudience = builder.Configuration[\\\\\\"Jwt:Audience\\\\\\"],\\\\n        IssuerSigningKey = new SymmetricSecurityKey(Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(jwtSecret))\\\\n    };\\\\n});\\",\\n      \\"code_after\\": \\"var jwtSecret = builder.Configuration[\\\\\\"Jwt:Key\\\\\\"] ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\\\\\\"JWT Secret Key not configured.\\\\\\");\\\\nvar jwtIssuer = builder.Configuration[\\\\\\"Jwt:Issuer\\\\\\"] ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\\\\\\"JWT Issuer not configured.\\\\\\");\\\\nvar jwtAudience = builder.Configuration[\\\\\\"Jwt:Audience\\\\\\"] ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\\\\\\"JWT Audience not configured.\\\\\\");\\\\nbuilder.Services.AddAuthentication(options =>\\\\n{\\\\n    options.DefaultAuthenticateScheme = JwtBearerDefaults.AuthenticationScheme;\\\\n    options.DefaultChallengeScheme = JwtBearerDefaults.AuthenticationScheme;\\\\n})\\\\n.AddJwtBearer(options =>\\\\n{\\\\n    options.TokenValidationParameters = new TokenValidationParameters\\\\n    {\\\\n        ValidateIssuer = true,\\\\n        ValidateAudience = true,\\\\n        ValidateLifetime = true,\\\\n        ValidateIssuerSigningKey = true,\\\\n        ValidIssuer = jwtIssuer,\\\\n        ValidAudience = jwtAudience,\\\\n        IssuerSigningKey = new SymmetricSecurityKey(Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(jwtSecret))\\\\n    };\\\\n});\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"finding_id\\": \\"F-002\\",\\n      \\"severity\\": \\"medium\\",\\n      \\"category\\": \\"quality\\",\\n      \\"title\\": \\"Missing validation for database connection string\\",\\n      \\"file\\": \\"src/Api/Program.cs\\",\\n      \\"line_range\\": [27, 28],\\n      \\"description\\": \\"The database connection string is retrieved without validation. If missing, UseNpgsql will throw a null reference exception during application startup.\\",\\n      \\"impact\\": \\"Application will fail to start if the \'DefaultConnection\' connection string is not configured.\\",\\n      \\"suggested_fix\\": \\"Validate the connection string and throw a descriptive exception if missing.\\",\\n      \\"code_before\\": \\"builder.Services.AddDbContextFactory<AppDbContext>(options =>\\\\n    options.UseNpgsql(builder.Configuration.GetConnectionString(\\\\\\"DefaultConnection\\\\\\")));\\",\\n      \\"code_after\\": \\"var connectionString = builder.Configuration.GetConnectionString(\\\\\\"DefaultConnection\\\\\\") \\\\n    ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\\\\\\"Database connection string \'DefaultConnection\' not configured.\\\\\\");\\\\nbuilder.Services.AddDbContextFactory<AppDbContext>(options =>\\\\n    options.UseNpgsql(connectionString));\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"finding_id\\": \\"F-003\\",\\n      \\"severity\\": \\"medium\\",\\n      \\"category\\": \\"quality\\",\\n      \\"title\\": \\"Missing GET endpoint for single todo retrieval\\",\\n      \\"file\\": \\"src/Api/Program.cs\\",\\n      \\"line_range\\": [95, 95],\\n      \\"description\\": \\"The API lacks an endpoint to retrieve a single todo by its ID, which is a common RESTful resource operation.\\",\\n      \\"impact\\": \\"Clients cannot fetch individual todos, limiting API usability. Additionally, the POST endpoint misuses CreatedAtRoute by pointing to a list endpoint instead of the created resource.\\",\\n      \\"suggested_fix\\": \\"Add a GET endpoint for /v1/todos/{id} that returns a single todo, and update the POST endpoint to use this new route in CreatedAtRoute.\\",\\n      \\"code_before\\": \\"\\",\\n      \\"code_after\\": \\"app.MapGet(\\\\\\"/v1/todos/{id}\\\\\\", [Authorize] async (Guid id, ITodoService todoService) =>\\\\n{\\\\n    var result = await todoService.GetTodoById(id);\\\\n    if (result.IsSuccess)\\\\n    {\\\\n        return Results.Ok(result.Value);\\\\n    }\\\\n    return Results.NotFound(result.Error);\\\\n})\\\\n.WithName(\\\\\\"GetTodoById\\\\\\")\\\\n.Produces<TodoResponse>(StatusCodes.Status200OK)\\\\n.Produces(StatusCodes.Status404NotFound);\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"finding_id\\": \\"F-004\\",\\n      \\"severity\\": \\"low\\",\\n      \\"category\\": \\"quality\\",\\n      \\"title\\": \\"Incorrect use of CreatedAtRoute in POST endpoint\\",\\n      \\"file\\": \\"src/Api/Program.cs\\",\\n      \\"line_range\\": [102, 102],\\n      \\"description\\": \\"The CreatedAtRoute method in the POST endpoint uses the route name \'GetAllTodos\' which returns a list of todos, not the specific todo that was created. This violates REST conventions for POST responses.\\",\\n      \\"impact\\": \\"The location header in the 201 response points to the list of todos instead of the created resource, causing client confusion when attempting to retrieve the newly created todo via the location header.\\",\\n      \\"suggested_fix\\": \\"Change the route name in CreatedAtRoute from \'GetAllTodos\' to \'GetTodoById\' (after adding the GET endpoint for single todo retrieval).\\",\\n      \\"code_before\\": \\"return Results.CreatedAtRoute(\\\\\\"GetAllTodos\\\\\\", new { id = result.Value.Id }, result.Value);\\",\\n      \\"code_after\\": \\"return Results.CreatedAtRoute(\\\\\\"GetTodoById\\\\\\", new { id = result.Value.Id }, result.Value);\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\"positive_observations\\": [\\n    \\"JWT secret is validated and throws descriptive exception if missing\\",\\n    \\"Global exception handler logs details and returns generic error message (avoids leaking sensitive information)\\",\\n    \\"HTTPS redirection is enforced via app.UseHttpsRedirection()\\",\\n    \\"Swagger is properly configured for development environments\\",\\n    \\"Authentication and Authorization middleware are correctly ordered\\",\\n    \\"All API endpoints are protected with [Authorize] attribute\\",\\n    \\"Asynchronous programming is used correctly with await on service calls\\",\\n    \\"The result pattern (IsSuccess, Value, Error) is used consistently for service responses\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n<<<ENDARTIFACT>>>"}'}